grades, and attract more demanding (and rewarding) moviegoers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541370/extras/3a85a04841100e5815f78d0878be1800.poster.avif?t=1756665723\" width=780 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541370/extras/3a85a04841100e5815f78d0878be1800.webm?t=1756665723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541370/extras/3a85a04841100e5815f78d0878be1800.mp4?t=1756665723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541370/extras/659ab41b8b8405b026218ecb32c32727.avif?t=1756665723\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the theater your own by designing the layout, placing decorations, and tailoring the interior to match your vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541370/extras/7ca2275b5f57de585760a8a649ae8ae4.avif?t=1756665723\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle unexpected situations like movie piracy, robberies, kids sneaking in, or customers smoking in the theater\u2014and try to keep things under control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["RAKTWO Games","steelbox Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541370/b187c2c676a176d6b51ed5066d78a1c54d7b0f4f/header.jpg?t=1756665723","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum: